| Pattern                 | Core trigger                           | Key invariant / question          | Must-know interview question                  | L6-level angle                                     |
| ----------------------- | -------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |
| HashMap / HashSet       | Fast lookup, frequency, duplicates     | What information must I remember? | Why Map vs Set?                               | Collision, memory, worst-case, Java implementation |
| Two Pointers            | Sorted/structured array, pair relation | Which pointer can I safely move?  | Why does moving this pointer eliminate cases? | Prove why search space shrinks                     |
| Sliding Window          | Contiguous substring/subarray          | When is window valid/invalid?     | When do I expand/shrink?                      | Maintain state incrementally                       |
| Prefix Sum              | Range sum / subarray sum               | `current - previous = target`?    | Why `map.put(0,1)`?                           | Count vs longest: frequency vs earliest index      |
| Binary Search           | Ordered/monotonic search space         | Can I eliminate half safely?      | Why is monotonicity required?                 | Boundary definition, correctness                   |
| Binary Search on Answer | Optimize min/max answer                | Is feasibility monotonic?         | What are low/high and predicate?              | Define search space + feasibility function         |
| Monotonic Stack         | Next greater/smaller, histogram        | Who is still unresolved?          | Why is each element pushed/popped once?       | Amortized O(n), invariant                          |
| Recursion               | Same problem on smaller state          | What is state/base/progress?      | What is recursion depth?                      | Recurrence derivation                              |
| Backtracking            | Enumerate possible solutions           | What are choices + how do I undo? | Why is undo mandatory?                        | State restoration invariant                        |
| Subsets I               | Include/exclude                        | `include OR exclude`              | Why `O(n·2ⁿ)`?                                | Output-sensitive complexity                        |
| Subsets II              | Duplicates                             | Skip **same-level** duplicates    | Why `i > start`?                              | Sibling vs path duplicate                          |
| Combination Sum         | Reusable candidates                    | Can current choice be reused?     | Why recurse with `i`?                         | State = start + target + path                      |
| Combination Sum II      | No reuse + duplicates                  | `i+1` + duplicate sibling pruning | Why sort first?                               | Combine multiple constraints correctly             |
| Generate Parentheses    | Constraint-based generation            | `close ≤ open`                    | When is `)` legal?                            | Invariant-driven pruning, Catalan complexity       |
| Letter Combinations     | Choice per input digit                 | Which digit am I processing?      | Why `index+1`?                                | Minimal recursive state                            |
| Palindrome Partitioning | Choose substring boundaries            | Is `s[start..end]` valid?         | Why `end+1`?                                  | Backtracking + DP preprocessing                    |
| Word Search             | Grid DFS                               | Is cell valid + unused?           | Why is visited path-local?                    | Correct state definition, mutation trade-off       |
| N-Queens                | Constraint placement                   | Column + 2 diagonals free?        | Why `row-col` and `row+col`?                  | O(1) constraint checks, bitmask optimization       |


