The patterns you should be able to recognize instantly
"Have I seen this before?"
        → HashMap / HashSet

"Contiguous substring/subarray?"
        → Sliding Window / Prefix Sum

"Need count of subarrays with target?"
        → Prefix Sum + HashMap

"Need longest subarray with target?"
        → Prefix Sum + earliest index

"Sorted / monotonic search space?"
        → Binary Search

"Minimize/maximize an answer, and I can test feasibility?"
        → Binary Search on Answer

"Next greater/smaller?"
        → Monotonic Stack

"Largest rectangle / nearest boundary?"
        → Monotonic Stack

"Generate all possibilities?"
        → Backtracking


